@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
<div class="nx-panel">
    <p>Nexus Communications collects only the information needed to provide telephone and internet service: your name, contact details, address, the documents you file with your application and the orders, connections, bills and payments that belong to your account.</p>
    <p>Your information is visible only to you and to authorised Nexus staff who need it for their work (retail shop, technical, accounts and administration). Uploaded documents are stored privately and are never served as public files.</p>
    <p>The public order and account tracker shows service status only. Billing amounts are shown only after you sign in.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">To correct or update your details, edit your profile after signing in or contact your nearest Nexus retail shop.</p>
</div>
